  "algorithm_basis": "Independent implementation imports no producer or CAD module. Recompute all complete face/edge/vertex support bounds directly from pinned original boundary inventory plus actual88 pcurves, with independent integer-bisection square roots. Verify full original displacement, determinant intersection bounds, closed outward carrier topology and exact directed volume, min-volume gate and original float64 threshold. All16 results must verify; false gate stays false. Native boundary semantics and compiled error bounds remain unresolved. V4 compressed runs are independently checked as exact unions of every original fine positive box, retaining all cut planes. The independent checker enumerates X/Y/Z triples exhaustively without the producer bisect optimization and checks every positive cell, no extra cells, exact total and positive-diagonal affine maps.",
